    [*] --> proposed
    proposed --> v1Card : Older project
    proposed --> v2Card : Current project

    v1Card --> v1Sending : Tap Create
    v1Sending --> rendering : Server accepts
    v1Sending --> v1Wait : Old render still running
    v1Sending --> v1Changed : Revision or plan moved
    v1Sending --> v1RawReason : Other refusal (about 17)
    v1Sending --> speechCheck : Speech check needed
    v1Wait --> v1Sending : Tap Create again later
    v1Changed --> v1Card : Refreshed card appears
    v1RawReason --> v1Replanning : Tap Refresh the direction
    v1Replanning --> v1Card : New plan, new hash
    speechCheck --> v1Sending : Pick an option

    v2Card --> v2WaitUploads : Tap Create, clips uploading
    v2WaitUploads --> v2Card : Uploads finish
    v2Card --> v2Deciding : Tap Create
    v2Card --> v2Deciding : Tap No thanks
    v2Card --> v2Expired : Timer ran out
    v2Deciding --> rendering : Approved
    v2Deciding --> declined : Declined
    v2Deciding --> v2SpeechRefresh : Speech-cleanup 409
    v2SpeechRefresh --> v2Card : Choose again
    v2Deciding --> v2Card : Revision moved, retry works
    v2Deciding --> v2Loop : Draft saved elsewhere (409)
    v2Loop --> v2Loop : Send a message (queued, waits)
    v2Loop --> v2Deciding : Tap Create again
    v2Loop --> v2Expired : Waits for expiry
    v2Loop --> declined : Tap No thanks
    v2Deciding --> v2StaleCancelled : Target stale
    v2Deciding --> v2ShapeRefused : Shape 422
    v2ShapeRefused --> v2Card : Pick another shape
    v2StaleCancelled --> thinking : Send a message
    v2Expired --> thinking : Send a message
    declined --> thinking : Send a message
    thinking --> proposed : New plan
    rendering --> [*]

